━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
_ PatternCollector'Item'Backing is Tuple
    - Backing is StorageBacking

+ items Array'Item'Backing
+ size Size
+ context Backing.Context

────────────────────
+ do grow Array'Item'Backing

?! Panic("Pattern collector size overflow")
    if size == Size.max
. capacity Size
if items.length == 0
    capacity = initial-capacity
else if items.length < 1024
    capacity = items.length * 2
else
    . half = items.length / 2
    ?! Panic("Pattern collector size overflow")
        if items.length > Size.max - half
    capacity = items.length + half
if capacity < size + 1
    capacity = size + 1
= items.resize(capacity, context)

.. initial-capacity =
    |? Item.size <= 16: 8
    |? Item.size <= 1024: 4
    ??: 1

